# A layer's state as a bar that has begun to fill -- the left end of Lean's, whose clip plays once and stays
# at its end, so the bar never goes back to nothing -- and the bar at the window's foot says the game runs.
# **Its first pixels, and not how far it has come** (a sweep): this asked for the fill three fifths of the
# way along, which is how much of the clip a machine has played by the shot. The editor's game follows the
# clock and the drive counts frames: six frames after Play the fill has not reached there, and on a machine
# six times as quick as a desk it would not have by the shot either.
